Source: postfix-ratelimitd
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Francis Russell <francis+ppa@unchartedbackwaters.co.uk>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: postfix-ratelimitd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Suggests: redis-server | valkey-server
Description: recipient rate-limiting policy daemon for Postfix
 postfix-ratelimitd is a Postfix SMTP access policy daemon that rate-limits
 recipients per SASL username within a sliding time window, backed by
 Valkey/Redis.
